Subject: [PATCH 51/52] ARM: dts: silk: Add r1ex24002 EEPROM to DT
Date: Fri, 16 Mar 2018 15:53:10 +0100
Message-Id: <adfca5ba9a7bfb36ffd9c5c6620c88e7076b47e3.1521208546.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
